EconoMind is a modified distribution maintained separately from Open Science.
Its changes include an economics and management research workbench, literature
screening and bibliometrics workflows, project classification, domain-specific
skills and specialists, interface and branding changes, removal of marketplace
and remote-access features, and workflow reliability fixes. The current
integration baseline is Open Science commit
c87a5668d6d53d2752ffb46b9f36a307cfca8cb1 (source version 0.34.1).
See UPSTREAM.md and OPEN_SOURCE.md for origin, scope and compatibility details.
In a source checkout, OPEN_SOURCE.md is located in docs/.

